    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "Since the p-adic norm |·|p maps elements of Qp to Qp, applying it componentwise to an n-tuple will result in another n-tuple with entries in Qp. Therefore, |Dpx|p is an n-tuple with entries in Qp."
  }, {
