    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "with initial seed x ∈ Qnp respect to Dp ∈ Mn×n(Qp). In this p-adic context, we deﬁne a p-adic Ducci map associated with a p-adic matrix Dp as a function that maps a p-adic vector x to |Dpx|p, where | · |p is applied elementwise."
