    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "Remark 1. In the ﬁeld of p-adic numbers Qp, the p-adic absolute value |x|p of a nonzero element x is deﬁned as:"
